# Database Schema

Local SQLite database for saved chess analysis sessions and per-move export rows (aligned with the frontend Excel export in `Analyze.jsx`).

## Overview

| Property | Value |
|---|---|
| Engine | SQLite (WAL journal mode) |
| File | `backend/data/chess_analysis.db` |
| Schema source | `backend/db/schema.sql` |
| Initialization | `backend/db/database.js` (applies schema + migrations on startup) |
| Foreign keys | Enabled (`PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON`) |

## Entity relationship

```
analysis_sessions (1) ──< (N) analysis_move_rows

lichess_pgn_uploads (1) ──< (N) lichess_pgn_games (1) ──< (N) lichess_pgn_moves
                                              ├──< (N) lichess_pgn_stage0
                                              ├──< (N) lichess_pgn_stage1
                                              └──< (N) lichess_pgn_stage2
```

## Tables

### `analysis_sessions`

Stores a single PGN analysis job and its progress.

| Column | Type | Nullable | Default | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `id` | INTEGER | NO | AUTOINCREMENT | Primary key |
| `created_at` | TEXT | NO | `datetime('now')` | ISO timestamp |
| `updated_at` | TEXT | NO | `datetime('now')` | ISO timestamp |
| `input_filename` | TEXT | YES | | Original upload filename |
| `input_source` | TEXT | YES | | Source identifier |
| `pgn_text` | TEXT | YES | | Full PGN input |
| `status` | TEXT | NO | `'pending'` | `pending`, `analyzing`, `completed`, or `failed` |
| `progress_current` | INTEGER | NO | `0` | Moves analyzed so far |
| `progress_total` | INTEGER | NO | `0` | Total moves to analyze |
| `error_message` | TEXT | YES | | Set when `status = 'failed'` |
| `notes` | TEXT | YES | | Free-form notes |
| `pgn_metadata` | TEXT | YES | | Serialized PGN header/metadata |

