## Indexes

| Name | Table | Columns | Unique |
|---|---|---|---|
| `idx_analysis_move_rows_session` | `analysis_move_rows` | `session_id` | No |
| `idx_analysis_move_rows_session_ply` | `analysis_move_rows` | `session_id`, `ply_index` | Yes |

### `lichess_pgn_uploads`

File upload metadata and import progress for bulk Lichess PGN dumps.

| Column | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `original_filename` | TEXT | User-facing name |
| `stored_filename` | TEXT | Name on disk under `backend/data/uploads/` |
| `file_path` | TEXT | Absolute path |
| `status` | TEXT | `uploaded`, `processing`, `completed`, `failed` |
| `range_from` / `range_to` | INTEGER | 1-based game range processed |
| `games_in_file` | INTEGER | Total games counted after upload |
| `games_saved` / `games_failed` / `moves_saved` | INTEGER | Progress counters |

### `lichess_pgn_games`

Cleaned single-game PGN per row (`chess.js` validated `clean_pgn` + JSON `pgn_metadata` headers).

### `lichess_pgn_moves`

Parsed ply rows: `san_move`, `uci_move`, `fen_before_move`, `fen_after_move`, etc.

### `lichess_pgn_stage0`

Brilliance Engine Stage 0 board-only features (one row per ply). Full feature blob in `features_json`; key columns indexed for filtering.

| Column | Notes |
|---|---|
| `game_id`, `move_id`, `ply_index` | Links to game + move row |
| `see_value` | Static Exchange Evaluation (negative = sacrifice signal) |
| `is_sacrifice_candidate` | Stage 0 gate → proceed to Stage 1 |
| `multiplexing_score`, `ev_score`, `harmony_score` | F04–F06 composites |
| `king_safety_delta` | Opponent king safety change after move |
| `proceed_to_stage1` | Same as sacrifice candidate gate |
| `features_json` | Full Stage 0 payload (setup, SEE, hanging, king safety, TM, EV, harmony) |

`lichess_pgn_games` also tracks `stage0_status`, `stage0_run_at`, `stage0_sacrifice_count`, `stage0_error`.

### `lichess_pgn_stage1`

Stage 1 sacrifice classification — **only Stage 0 candidates**, no engine.

| Column | Notes |
|---|---|
| `sac_type` | queen_sacrifice, exchange_sacrifice, real_sacrifice, pseudo_sacrifice, positional_piece_placement, tactical_sacrifice |
| `disqualifiers_json` | trade_not_sacrifice, piece_was_already_hanging |
| `is_valid_sacrifice` | Passes all disqualifiers |
| `is_pseudo` | Material recovered via forced recapture |
| `material_loss_cp` | cap_val − piece_val (negative = loss) |
| `sacrifice_uncertainty` | Variance across recapture scenarios |
| `is_forced` / `forced_reason` | only_legal_move, check_few_options |
| `proceed_to_stage2` | valid sacrifice AND not forced → Stockfish at Stage 2 |

`lichess_pgn_games` also tracks `stage1_status`, `stage1_run_at`, `stage1_candidate_count`, `stage1_valid_count`, `stage1_proceed_stage2_count`, `stage1_error`.

### `lichess_pgn_stage2`

Stage 2 shallow Stockfish — **only Stage 1 `proceed_to_stage2` moves**. Uses `stockfish-windows-x86-64-avx2.exe` via python-chess `SimpleEngine`, depth 12 multipv 5.

| Column | Notes |
|---|---|
| `best_move`, `best_score_cp`, `our_score_cp`, `our_rank_in_top5` | Engine comparison — **white POV** (`score.white()`) |
| `cpl_shallow` | Centipawn loss vs best move |
| `ep_delta_shallow` | Expected points change (sigmoid of cp) |
| `is_forced_engine` | ≤2 moves within 150cp of best at d12 |
| `response_width` | Opponent replies within 120cp at d10 |
| `proceed_to_stage3` | Passes CPL ≤300, not engine-forced, EP Δ ≥ −0.15 |

**Stage 2 gate (disqualifiers):** `cpl_shallow > 300` · `is_forced_engine` · `ep_delta_shallow < -0.15`

`lichess_pgn_games` also tracks `stage2_status`, `stage2_run_at`, `stage2_analyzed_count`, `stage2_proceed_stage3_count`, `stage2_error`.

### `lichess_pgn_stage3`

Stage 3 deep Stockfish — **only Stage 2 `proceed_to_stage3` moves**. Depth curve d5–25, rank d8/d22, defense d18. All stored cp values use **white POV** (+ = white better).

| Column | Notes |
|---|---|
| `deep_eval_cp` | Position after move at d25 (white POV) |
| `depth_slope`, `depth_gain`, `depth_variance` | Depth curve metrics (computed on mover-relative curve) |
| `rank_at_depth8`, `rank_at_depth22`, `rank_jump` | Non-obviousness rank shift |
| `non_obvious_score` | Composite 0–10 brilliance signal |
| `defense_difficulty`, `good_defenses` | Opponent defense scan at d18 |
| `is_sound` | Mover eval at d25 ≥ −30cp |
| `classification_if_unsound` | e.g. `speculative_sacrifice` (soft gate, still → Stage 4) |
| `depth_evals_json` | Map depth → white POV cp |

`lichess_pgn_games` also tracks `stage3_status`, `stage3_run_at`, `stage3_analyzed_count`, `stage3_sound_count`, `stage3_error`.

### `lichess_pgn_stage4`

Stage 4 human perception — **Stage 3 passers only**. No engine. Combines Stage 0/1/3 features with player Elo from PGN.

| Column | Notes |
|---|---|
| `player_rating` | WhiteElo/BlackElo from PGN for mover |
| `surprise_score`, `info_surprise_bits` | Rating-relative non-obviousness (0–10) |
| `pb_score`, `pb_category` | Practical brilliance (objective / Tal zone / speculative) |
| `archetype` | masterstroke, thunderbolt, ignition, quiet_masterstroke, etc. |
| `brilliance_score` | Weighted final 0–10 |
| `classification` | BRILLIANT, practical_brilliant, great_sacrifice, good_sacrifice |
| `is_brilliant` | classification === BRILLIANT |

`lichess_pgn_games` also tracks `stage4_status`, `stage4_run_at`, `stage4_analyzed_count`, `stage4_brilliant_count`, `stage4_error`.

**API**

| Method | Path | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/api/lichess-pgns/games/:gameId/stage0/run` | Stage 0 (no engine) |
| GET | `/api/lichess-pgns/games/:gameId/stage0` | Stage 0 results |
| POST | `/api/lichess-pgns/games/:gameId/stage1/run` | Stage 1 (requires Stage 0) |
| GET | `/api/lichess-pgns/games/:gameId/stage1` | Stage 1 results |
| POST | `/api/lichess-pgns/games/:gameId/stage2/run` | Stage 2 Stockfish (requires Stage 1) |
| GET | `/api/lichess-pgns/games/:gameId/stage2` | Stage 2 results |
| POST | `/api/lichess-pgns/games/:gameId/stage3/run` | Stage 3 deep Stockfish (requires Stage 2 passers) |
| GET | `/api/lichess-pgns/games/:gameId/stage3` | Stage 3 results |
| POST | `/api/lichess-pgns/games/:gameId/stage4/run` | Stage 4 human model (requires Stage 3) |
| GET | `/api/lichess-pgns/games/:gameId/stage4` | Stage 4 results — brilliance score, archetype |
| POST | `/api/lichess-pgns/games/:gameId/brilliance/run` | Run Stage 0 → 1 → 2 → 3 → 4 (page load) |

**API (uploads)**

| Method | Path | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/api/lichess-pgns/upload` | Multipart `file` → creates upload, counts games |
| POST | `/api/lichess-pgns/uploads/:id/process` | `{ range_from, range_to }` → clean + save |
| GET | `/api/lichess-pgns/stats` | Totals |
| GET | `/api/lichess-pgns/uploads` | Recent uploads |
| GET | `/api/lichess-pgns/uploads/:id/games` | Paginated clean games |

## Full schema (SQL)

```sql
-- Local SQLite schema for saved analysis sessions and per-move export rows
-- (aligned with frontend Excel export in Analyze.jsx)

PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON;

CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS analysis_sessions (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
  created_at TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT (datetime('now')),
  updated_at TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT (datetime('now')),
  input_filename TEXT,
  input_source TEXT,
  pgn_text TEXT,
  status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'pending'
    CHECK (status IN ('pending', 'analyzing', 'completed', 'failed')),
  progress_current INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
  progress_total INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
  error_message TEXT,
  notes TEXT,
  pgn_metadata TEXT
);

CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS analysis_move_rows (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
  session_id INTEGER NOT NULL,
  ply_index INTEGER NOT NULL,
  move_number TEXT,
  turn TEXT,
  san_move TEXT,
  uci_move TEXT,
  clock TEXT,
  played_move_classification TEXT,
  played_move_standing TEXT,
  played_move_eval TEXT,
  eval_before_move TEXT,
  move_quality_delta TEXT,
  best_line_delta TEXT,
  win_pct_white TEXT,
  fen_before_move TEXT,
  fen_after_move TEXT,
  legal_moves_at_move TEXT,
  best_move_alternatives TEXT,
  captures TEXT,
  game_phase TEXT,
  board_density TEXT,
  white_space_dominance TEXT,
  black_space_dominance TEXT,
  white_material TEXT,
  black_material TEXT,
  material_advantage TEXT,
  simplification TEXT,
  hanging_pieces TEXT,
  loose_pieces TEXT,
  white_king_attack_intensity TEXT,
  white_king_exposure TEXT,
  black_king_attack_intensity TEXT,
  black_king_exposure TEXT,
  white_king_mobility TEXT,
  black_king_mobility TEXT,
  white_pawn_islands TEXT,
  white_doubled_pawns TEXT,
  black_pawn_islands TEXT,
  black_doubled_pawns TEXT,
  white_avg_mobility TEXT,
  black_avg_mobility TEXT,
  white_position_freedom TEXT,
  black_position_freedom TEXT,
  white_space_controlled TEXT,
  black_space_controlled TEXT,
  space_ratio TEXT,
  pins TEXT,
  forks TEXT,
  endgame_proximity TEXT,
  white_practical_risk TEXT,
  black_practical_risk TEXT,
  overall_evaluation TEXT,
  winning_plan TEXT,
  line_1_eval TEXT,
  line_1_classification TEXT,
  line_1_sequence TEXT,
  line_2_eval TEXT,
  line_2_classification TEXT,
  line_2_sequence TEXT,
  line_3_eval TEXT,
  line_3_classification TEXT,
  line_3_sequence TEXT,
  line_4_eval TEXT,
  line_4_classification TEXT,
  line_4_sequence TEXT,
  line_5_eval TEXT,
  line_5_classification TEXT,
  line_5_sequence TEXT,
  line_6_eval TEXT,
  line_6_classification TEXT,
  line_6_sequence TEXT,
  line_7_eval TEXT,
  line_7_classification TEXT,
  line_7_sequence TEXT,
  line_8_eval TEXT,
  line_8_classification TEXT,
  line_8_sequence TEXT,
  line_9_eval TEXT,
  line_9_classification TEXT,
  line_9_sequence TEXT,
  line_10_eval TEXT,
  line_10_classification TEXT,
  line_10_sequence TEXT,
  stockfish_json TEXT,
  pipeline_json TEXT,
  FOREIGN KEY (session_id) REFERENCES analysis_sessions(id) ON DELETE CASCADE
);

CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_analysis_move_rows_session
  ON analysis_move_rows(session_id);

CREATE UNIQUE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_analysis_move_rows_session_ply
  ON analysis_move_rows(session_id, ply_index);
```

## Migrations

On startup, `database.js` runs lightweight migrations against existing databases:

- **Dropped columns** (table rebuild): `sacrifices`, `tempo`, `generated_commentary`, `ml_inputs_json`, `ml_predictions_json`, `flan_t5_output`
- **Added columns**: `best_line_delta`, `pipeline_json`
- **Dropped tables**: `behavioral_stories`, `pgn_import_batches`, `pgn_import_raw_games`
- **Dropped session columns** (table rebuild): `import_batch_id`, `import_game_index`, `lichess_game_id`

When changing the schema, update `schema.sql` and add a matching migration in `database.js`.
